>Portfolio<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a><a class="neo-header-link type-menu flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-black/5 " href="/contact" data-discover="true">Contact<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a></div><div class="border-t border-black/5 p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="neo-mobile-support sm:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_7mcj5_" class="neo-button neo-button--primary neo-mobile-support-trigger w-full justify-center uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble_outline</span>Chat with us<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">expand_less</span></button><div id="_R_7mcj5_" hidden="" class="neo-mobile-support-card rounded-2xl p-2"><a href="https://wa.me/8801625957738?text=Hi%20EdiCut%2C%20I&#x27;d%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20video%20editing." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp" class="neo-button neo-button--primary neo-mobile-whatsapp-link w-full justify-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]" aria-hidden="true">chat</span>WhatsApp</a></div></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary w-full uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" href="/signin?mode=signin&amp;redirectTo=%2Fdashboard" data-discover="true"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]">login</span>Sign in</a></div></div></div><main data-analytics-region="page-content"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Service","@id":"https://edicut.com/services/short-form-video-editing#service","name":"Short-form video editing","serviceType":"Short-form video editing","description":"Create focused Shorts, Reels, and TikTok videos with EdiCut. Plan hooks, vertical framing, readable captions, and cutdowns from longer recordings.","url":"https://edicut.com/services/short-form-video-editing","provider":{"@id":"https://edicut.com/#organization"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://edicut.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Services","item":"https://edicut.com/services"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Short-form video editing","item":"https://edicut.com/services/short-form-video-editing"}]}]}</script><div class="services-container"><nav class="services-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/" data-discover="true">Home</a></li><li><a href="/services" data-discover="true">Services</a></li><li aria-current="page">Short-form video editing</li></ol></nav><section class="services-hero service-detail-hero" aria-labelledby="service-title"><div><h1 id="service-title">Short-form video editing</h1><p class="services-lead">Give one idea a strong opening, a clear payoff, and a vertical edit designed for small screens.</p><div class="services-actions"><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a><a class="services-text-link" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Explore editing examples</a></div></div><aside class="services-hero-note" aria-label="Service overview"><dl class="services-overview"><div><dt>Format</dt><dd>Shorts, Reels, and TikTok</dd></div><div><dt>Editing focus</dt><dd>One idea, readable on a small screen</dd></div></dl></aside></section><section class="services-section services-introduction" aria-labelledby="service-approach-title"><div><h2 id="service-approach-title">An edit built around your content.</h2><p class="services-audience">Creators and brands producing YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, TikTok videos, or clips from longer content.</p></div><p>A short video needs to make sense on its own. We edit original short recordings and cutdowns from longer videos around one useful idea, moment, or story. Instead of simply cropping a full video, the brief covers the opening, context, captions, framing, and intended platform for each piece.</p></section><section class="services-section" aria-labelledby="service-work-title"><div class="services-section-heading"><h2 id="service-work-title">What we work on</h2><p>We agree on the deliverables and level of finishing before the project begins.</p></div><div class="services-deliverables"><article><h3>A self-contained cut</h3><p>Start with the moment or question that makes the clip understandable, then trim the sequence around its payoff. Include enough context to represent the original speaker accurately.</p></article><article><h3>Thoughtful vertical framing</h3><p>Reframe usable source footage for the agreed aspect ratio, keeping faces and relevant actions in view. Tell us where platform controls or your own overlays need space.</p></article><article><h3>Captions and on-screen emphasis</h3><p>Use legible captions and selective text to help the viewer follow the clip. Your references establish how restrained or expressive the graphics should be.</p></article></div></section><section class="services-section services-preparation" aria-labelledby="service-brief-title"><div><h2 id="service-brief-title">A useful brief starts here.</h2><p>These details help the team assess your footage, understand your style, and set a realistic scope.</p><a class="services-text-link" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Get help with your brief <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></div><ul><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>The original recording or links to the longer source video, with suitable quality for reframing.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Your chosen moments or a brief for selecting them, plus the number of clips required.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Destination platforms, target duration, aspect ratios, and any text-safe area requirements.</span></li><li><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Brand fonts, caption references, correct names, and your preferred call to action.</span></li></ul></section><section class="services-section" aria-labelledby="service-process-title"><div class="services-section-heading"><h2 id="service-process-title">From brief to approval</h2><p>A shared direction, a review, and an agreed final delivery.</p></div><ol class="services-process"><li><h3>Define the clip</h3><p>Agree on the audience, central idea, quantity, and source footage. Choosing moments from a long recording can require different scope from editing supplied timestamps.</p></li><li><h3>Review on a small screen</h3><p>Check that the opening makes sense, captions stay readable, and important details remain visible. Give timestamped feedback on wording, timing, and framing.</p></li><li><h3>Approve each version</h3><p>Review the agreed platform exports and revisions. If the same idea needs different cuts or aspect ratios, include those versions in the project brief.</p></li></ol></section><section class="services-section services-questions" aria-labelledby="service-questions-title"><h2 id="service-questions-title">Questions about <!-- -->short-form video editing</h2><div><details><summary>Can you turn a long YouTube video or podcast into short clips?</summary><p>Yes. Share the source and either your preferred timestamps or a brief for finding useful moments. Confirm the number of clips, target lengths, and whether clip selection is part of the quoted work.</p></details><details><summary>Can one short video be used on several platforms?</summary><p>Often it can, but platform overlays, duration limits, framing, music rights, and your publishing goals may require changes. List every destination so the team can confirm the versions you need.</p></details><details><summary>Do you guarantee views or viral results?</summary><p>No. Editing can improve clarity and presentation, but reach depends on the topic, audience, publishing decisions, and platform distribution. We agree on the creative work and deliverables for your project.</p></details></div></section><section class="services-closing" aria-labelledby="service-next-title"><div><h2 id="service-next-title">Make room for your next upload.</h2><p>See current packages, scope, and revision allowances, or share your brief for help choosing.</p></div><div class="services-actions"><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">View pricing</a><a class="services-text-link" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Talk with the team</a></div></section><nav class="services-related" aria-label="Related services"><h2>Explore related services</h2><ul><li><a href="/services/podcast-video-editing" data-discover="true">Podcast video editing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="/services/youtube-video-editing" data-discover="true">YouTube video editing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a href="/services/gaming-video-editing" data-discover="true">Gaming video editing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul><a class="services-text-link" href="/services" data-discover="true">View all services</a></nav></div></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-ex